---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Beneru | AI Marketing Direction & Systems" 
  description="Learn about Reuben (Ben) Magallanes, co-founder of Spawntel, building AI-directed marketing workflows and autonomous acquisition systems."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="json-ld">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "mainEntity": {
        "@id": "https://beneru.spawntel.com/#person"
      }
    }
  </script>

  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <h1>Replacing manual marketing hustle with intelligent systems</h1>
      <p class="lead">My name is Reuben Magallanes, but most people know me as Ben (Beneru). I am the co-founder of Spawntel, building intelligent workflow systems and AI marketing engines for modern brands and ambitious founders.</p>
      
      <p>I watched founders and marketing teams spend 70% of their workday trapped in manual grind: re-editing captions for five channels, chasing cold leads in DMs, manually tweaking ad creatives, and struggling with inconsistent distribution.</p>
      
      <p>Big tech corporations have entire divisions of media buyers and operations specialists. Smaller companies and lean teams are forced to do everything by hand, resulting in creative fatigue and lost revenue.</p>

      <p>That is why I build AI-directed marketing systems. By coupling intelligent multi-agent workflows with direct-response marketing principles, we turn content distribution and customer acquisition into an autonomous machine that runs in the background.</p>
      
      <h2>My Philosophy</h2>
      <p>I believe in clean, invisible technology. The best marketing system is one you never have to babysit. It captures attention, qualifies buyer intent, and books customers while you focus on building your craft.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0;
  }
  .content-wrapper {
    max-width: 72ch;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border-subtle);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-highlight), var(--glass-shadow);
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  p {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
